(1015, 'Tuesday Fellowship 13th May 2025 ', '2025-05-13 16:35:11', '2025-05-13 19:00:00', 11, 'https://meet.google.com/ste-crhg-ssd', 1, '<p><strong>DAY 9 PRAYER AND FASTING</strong></p><p>We are praying for the entire week, you can join us in our prayers.&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Prayer Directions</strong></i></p><blockquote><ol><li>Family<ol><li>We pray that the peace of God rules and prevails in our families.</li><li>We pray that the blessing of God is evident in our families.</li><li>We pray that the members of our families receive tye salvation in our Lord Jesus.</li><li>We pray that the purpose of God is defined in the family unit.</li><li>We pray that the family institution is established worldwide.</li><li>We pray that the plans of the enemy against the family institution are thwarted.</li></ol></li></ol><p>2. Finances.</p><ul><li>We pray that we have an established financial discipline&nbsp;</li><li>We pray that we have the wisdom to steward finances.</li><li>We pray that the purpose of God regarding finances prevails.</li></ul><p>JOIN US FROM 8.00PM TO 9.00PM FOR PRAYER</p></blockquote>', NULL, NULL, NULL),
